msgstr ""

#: ../../source/find-up_readme.md:124
msgid ""
"A [`Symbol`](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Symbol) that can be "
"returned by a `matcher` function to stop the search and cause `findUp` to"
" immediately return `undefined`. Useful as a performance optimization in "
"case the current working directory is deeply nested in the filesystem."
msgstr ""

